 ### Smooth Intersection
-Similar to Smooth Union, this operation creates a smooth transition for the intersection of two shapes [S3, unofficial]. It retains the common part but blends the boundary smoothly using the `smin` function with a smoothness parameter $k$ [S3, unofficial].
